{"additions":171,"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\n\nCloses #156.\n\n- **GitHub page** — `y` on the issue / PR / run lists and inside their detail views copies the item's URL. Issues / PRs build it locally from the origin remote (`parse_github_nwo`, no API request); runs use the URL the list already has.\n- **Projects page** — `y` on the board / table copies the item's URL (drafts fall back to the project URL, same resolution as `o`), and on the optional `projects` list pane the project URL.\n- **Git page** — `y` on the git log stays the hash copy; `Y` copies the commit's GitHub URL. The log's `o` (open commit) previously went through `gh repo view` — it now builds the URL locally too, matching #141.\n- Feedback: single-line clipboard copies now show `Copied <text>` in the status bar (multi-line yanks keep `Yanked N lines`); a non-github.com remote gets `No URL for this item` instead.\n- Shared `copy_url_event` helper; `GhListItem` gains a `copy_url()` method.\n\n## Docs / demo\n\n- README en/ja, guide GitHub / Projects / Git chapters and both Config Reference action tables list the new bindings.\n- `tape/demo-github-issue.tape` gets a `y` moment (status bar shows `Copied https://github.com/td72/vig/issues/153`); GIF re-recorded.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `copy_url_event` unit test; 354 tests green, clippy clean.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TreGn5Xh4PjDRv9Yo4QU4w","changedFiles":23,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-03T05:44:59Z","deletions":18,"headRefName":"feat/copy-url","labels":[],"number":157,"reviewDecision":"","reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABL-E0Lw","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nThere are a few concrete correctness/behavior mismatches (URL fallback logic and spec-aligned status messaging) that should be addressed before approval.\n\n*Once you've addressed the issues Copilot identified, you can request another Copilot review.*\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull request overview</summary>\n\nThis PR adds URL-copy actions to vig’s TUI so users can copy the same URLs that `o` can open in a browser (without extra API calls where URLs are derivable), and updates keymaps, docs, and demo assets accordingly.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Add `y`/`Y` bindings to copy URLs across GitHub, Projects, and Git log views (with a shared `copy_url_event` helper and locally-derived URLs for issues/PRs/commits).\n- Update clipboard feedback so single-line copies show `Copied <text>` in the status bar, while multi-line yanks keep a line-count message.\n- Update README/guide/config-reference docs and refresh the GitHub issue demo tape/GIF.\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>File summaries</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| tape/demo-github-issue.tape | Adds a recorded `y` moment demonstrating URL copy in the GitHub issues list. |\r\n| src/projects/panes/projects.rs | Adds `CopyUrl` action/keybinding to copy a project URL from the Projects list pane. |\r\n| src/projects/panes/board.rs | Adds `CopyUrl` action/keybinding and shared URL resolution for project board/table items. |\r\n| src/github/panes/run_list.rs | Implements `copy_url()` for workflow run list items using the run’s existing URL field. |\r\n| src/github/panes/pr_list.rs | Implements `copy_url()` for PR list items via locally-built PR URLs. |\r\n| src/github/panes/issue_list.rs | Implements `copy_url()` for issue list items via locally-built issue URLs. |\r\n| src/github/panes/gh_list.rs | Adds `CopyUrl` list action, `GhListItem::copy_url()`, and the shared `copy_url_event` helper + unit test. |\r\n| src/github/panes/detail_view/mod.rs | Adds `y` to detail views to copy the shown issue/PR/run URL. |\r\n| src/github/domain/client.rs | Exposes cached origin-derived NWO internally and adds `issue_url`/`pr_url`/`commit_url` helpers. |\r\n| src/git/panes/git_log/mod.rs | Keeps `y` as hash copy; adds `Y` to copy commit URL and updates `o` to use locally-built commit URL. |\r\n| src/core/app.rs | Updates clipboard status messaging to show `Copied <text>` for single-line copies. |\r\n| README.md | Documents new `y`/`Y` bindings in relevant view key tables. |\r\n| docs/README.ja.md | Japanese README updates for new `y`/`Y` bindings. |\r\n| docs/guide/src/views-projects.md | Projects view guide updated to include `y` URL copy. |\r\n| docs/guide/src/views-github.md | GitHub view guide updated to include `y` URL copy (local build/no API). |\r\n| docs/guide/src/views-git.md | Git view guide updated to include `Y` commit URL copy. |\r\n| docs/guide/src/config-reference.md | Config reference updated with `CopyUrl`/`YankUrl` action entries. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/views-projects.md | Japanese Projects view guide updated for `y` URL copy. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/views-github.md | Japanese GitHub view guide updated for `y` URL copy. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/views-git.md | Japanese Git view guide updated for `Y` commit URL copy. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/config-reference.md | Japanese config reference updated with `CopyUrl`/`YankUrl` action entries. |\r\n| assets/demo-github-issue.gif | Re-recorded demo GIF reflecting the new `y` behavior (LFS pointer updated). |\r\n| assets/default.kdl | Adds default key bindings for `CopyUrl`/`YankUrl` across the relevant panes. |\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 23/23 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 3\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/td72/vig/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>","submittedAt":"2026-09-03T05:47:56Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"bcf10031402a398a2bdfaa80a3344f17f3bd1ea7"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABL-HYIQ","author":{"login":"td72"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"","submittedAt":"2026-09-03T05:54:13Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"e38379ab6f739a2f38e8309f262c8190015bc71a"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABL-HZFw","author":{"login":"td72"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"","submittedAt":"2026-09-03T05:54:15Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"e38379ab6f739a2f38e8309f262c8190015bc71a"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABL-HaSA","author":{"login":"td72"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"","submittedAt":"2026-09-03T05:54:17Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"e38379ab6f739a2f38e8309f262c8190015bc71a"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABL-I8ig","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🔵 Needs a closer look\n\nSeveral docstrings/docs currently claim URLs are always “built locally”, but workflow-run URLs are copied from already-fetched data, so wording should be corrected for accuracy.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n### Suppressed comments (4)\n\n**Previously missed (4)** — in code that hasn't changed since the last review.\n\n**docs/guide/ja/src/views-github.md:50**\n* This description says the URL is always “ローカルで構築”, but workflow run URLs are copied from already-fetched run data (issues/PRs are derived locally). The wording should reflect both cases.\n**docs/guide/src/views-github.md:51**\n* This table entry claims the URL is “built locally”, but workflow run URLs are copied from already-fetched run data (issues/PRs are derived locally). Wording should reflect that nuance.\n**src/github/panes/detail_view/mod.rs:113**\n* The `CopyUrl` action comment says the URL is “built locally”, but for workflow runs this uses `d.run.url` from fetched data rather than deriving locally. The doc comment should match the actual behavior.\n**src/github/panes/gh_list.rs:76**\n* The `GhListItem::copy_url()` doc comment says the URL is always “built locally”, but `WorkflowRun::copy_url()` returns the already-fetched API URL. This makes the trait contract misleading for implementors/callers.\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 23/23 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 0 new\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>","submittedAt":"2026-09-03T05:57:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"e38379ab6f739a2f38e8309f262c8190015bc71a"}}],"state":"MERGED","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-03T06:23:44Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33723010939/job/100545953503","name":"create-tag","startedAt":"2026-09-03T06:23:51Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-03T05:55:31Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33720823107/job/100539417750","name":"build (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-03T05:54:09Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-03T05:54:44Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33720823113/job/100539417823","name":"lint","startedAt":"2026-09-03T05:54:09Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-03T05:55:11Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/33720823107/job/100539417707","name":"build (aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-24.04-arm)","startedAt":"2026-09-03T05:54:09Z","status":"COMPLE